OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fdry this evening and into the night
OL,7,Fwith clear spells. Mist and fog
OL,8,Fforming through the early hours across
OL,9,Fmost of the region. A chillier night
OL,10,Fthan the last.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FMist and fog gradually lift,
OL,13,Fbefore a band of low cloud and patchy
OL,14,Frain moves south through the day,
OL,15,Fclearing by late evening. Light winds
OL,16,Fand temperatures near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
