OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FLargely fine and dry on Monday with
OL,7,Fhigh pressure in charge. Cloudier and
OL,8,Fbreezier thereafter, with a few
OL,9,Fshowers around. Temperatures near
OL,10,Faverage but feeling chilly overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
